:"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.dfrobot.com/product-2665.html","title":null}}],"text":"（DFRobot）"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"TonyBox（NFC 音乐盒）："},{"type":"text","text":"ESP32-C3 + NFC + DFPlayer + WS2812，刷不同卡播不同儿歌，3D 打印外壳，全程离线。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.printables.com/model/1623405","title":null}}],"text":"（Printables）"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"Michael''s Musical Keyboard："},{"type":"text","text":"ESP32-C3 Super Mini + 机械轴 + DFPlayer + 18650，每个键播一首宝宝爱听的歌。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://galmakes.com/project/musical-keyboard","title":null}}],"text":"（GalMakes）"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"Kinderdorp PCB / Music Baby 固件："},{"type":"text","text":"分别是教学板（8 颗 WS2812 + 蜂鸣器）和现成 ESP32-C3 音乐固件（带屏+三键），适合做声音/灯光类玩具。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://github.com/Casperdroid5/Kinderdorp-PCB","title":null}}],"text":"（GitHub）"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、我的推荐：会听话的小车（语音控制 + 儿歌）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"综合「安全、好做、娃爱玩、你要的 AI 语音」，最推荐做一台 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"语音控制小车"},{"type":"text","text":"：ESP32-C3 驱动两个减速电机（TB6612），SU-03T 听中文指令，再让 C3 直接调用大模型把话变成动作；同时配 WS2812 状态灯和 DFPlayer 放儿歌。娃说「走」它就走，因果反馈极强。"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"type":"info"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"为什么适合 2 岁：① 动起来最吸引人；② 离线关键词做「耳朵」、云/本地大模型做「大脑」，各司其职；③ 低速 + 软包边 + 自动停，安全可控；④ 儿歌和灯光越玩越熟。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三、AI 从哪来：C3 能直接调大模型（重点澄清）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"先纠正一个常见误解——C3 虽然 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"跑不动"},{"type":"text","text":" 模型，但它 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"带 WiFi，完全可以直接调用云端大模型 API（一次 HTTPS 请求）"},{"type":"text","text":"。换句话说，让 C3 自己联网把话「问」给 GPT / 通义 / DeepSeek，拿回结构化指令再执行，这条路不仅可行，而且比绕一圈用手机更简单。真正的难点只有一个："},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"语音转文字（ASR）"},{"type":"text","text":"——C3 没有做语音识别的算力，这一步得靠别的。"}]},{"type":"bullet_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"路线 A · 离线关键词（最稳，先做）："},{"type":"text","text":"SU-03T / DFRobot 语音模块自带 DSP，离线识别你定义好的中文词，串口吐命令 ID。零延迟、不联网、适合娃。半天可成。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"路线 B · C3 直连大模型 API（真 AI，推荐升级）："},{"type":"text","text":"SU-03T 先把话变成文字（或把固定词当意图），C3 通过 WiFi 用 HTTPS 把文本发给大模型，模型返回结构化指令 {action, seconds}；C3 解析后驱电机。整个过程 C3 自己完成，不用手机。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"路线 C · 本地模型（隐私优先）："},{"type":"text","text":"家里跑一台 Ollama（如 qwen2.5:0.5b），C3 走局域网 11434 端口调用，语音和指令都不出家门——既离线又「有脑子」。"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"type":"info"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"关键点：「直接调大模型」在 C3 上就是一次 HTTPS POST（用 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"WiFiClientSecure"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"HTTPClient"},{"type":"text","text":"），返回 JSON 解析即可，对 C3 的算力完全没压力。唯一要补的是「耳朵」（ASR）：要么用 SU-03T 离线识别，要么把音频流送云 ASR（如讯飞 / 火山 / OpenAI Whisper API）。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"四、物料清单（BOM）"}]},{"type":"t