"colwidth":[130]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"省钱版"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[430]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REDMI G27Q 240Hz（多功能支架版）899 + DP1.4 线 30"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[110]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"约 930"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[229]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"显卡中端、以 3A 为主、偶尔写代码"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[130]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"推荐版"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[430]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REDMI G27U 2026（1303，赶上国补）+ DP1.4 线 30"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[110]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"约 1330"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[229]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"写代码 + 3A 双修，显卡 5060 Ti 以上"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[130]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"护眼办公版"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[430]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"飞利浦 27E2N5901RW（约 1500），笔记本一线连，不另买扩展坞"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[110]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"约 1500"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colwidth":[229]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一天十小时看文字，游戏只是偶尔"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两个小提醒："},{"type":"text","text":"线材别省","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"——4K 160Hz 必须用 DP1.4 及以上（或 HDMI2.1），包装里送的线常常只够 4K 60Hz；"},{"type":"text","text":"支架臂可以后补","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，但机器本身必须带 100×100 VESA 孔，75×75 的入门款将来想上臂会很别扭。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"五、八个参数陷阱，看到就绕开"}]},{"type":"ordered_list","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「1ms 响应」不是响应时间。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"页面写的多是 MPRT 或「最快」档，实际 GTG 在 3–5ms 属正常；真正的差距在 OD 调校，过冲严重会出现反向拖影，只能看实测。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"HDR400 基本等于没有 HDR。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"400nit 峰值 + 无分区背光，开了只会整体发灰。这个价位的 HDR 当赠品看，不要为它加钱。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「低蓝光模式」和「硬件低蓝光」是两件事。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"前者是软件滤镜、开了会发黄；后者从背光层滤，不偏色。要买就买后者，并且确认「全程 DC 调光」，否则低亮度下还是 PWM 频闪。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷新率的「超频」字样要看清。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"180Hz 超频、240Hz 超频，原生往往低一档。原生和超频在拖影、稳定性上是两回事。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4K 高刷要确认 DSC。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"DP1.4 带宽跑不满 4K 160Hz，靠 DSC 压缩实现；显卡和线材都要支持，否则自动掉到 4K 120Hz 甚至 60Hz。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同型号不同 SKU 会换面板/支架。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"「标准版 / 多功能支架版 / 护眼版」经常是不同底座甚至不同面板，参数页逐个对，别只看型号名。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"国补不是显示器的既定权益。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"政策文本的家电 6 类、数码 4 类里都没有单独列显示器（「电脑」指整机），但部分平台商品页确实挂了国家补贴标签，属地区试点与渠道口径差异——结算页减了才算，别按「一定会减 15%」做预算。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"价保不跨链接。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"同款商品在店里可能挂两条链接，价保只认自己那条。下单前记下链接价格，活动期结束前再比一次。"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"六、下单到验机：一张清单"}]},{"type":"task_list","content":[{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"确认显卡型号","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，回到第一节的表格对号入座，再决定 4K 还是 2K。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"量桌面深度","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：27 寸屏 + 支架底座大约要吃 20–25cm 进深，桌子 60cm 深的话，支架臂比原装底座更省地方。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"把「升降旋转版」加进购物车","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，别顺手点了默认的标准支架 SKU。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下单前查一眼结算页","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：品类券、店铺券、国补是否都生效；国补商品要单独成单，合并结算会整单失效。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"收货当天验机","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：纯色图看坏点（黑/白/红/绿/蓝各一张）、纯黑看漏光与阴阳屏、纯白看色温是否一边黄一边白。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"七天之内决定去留","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：坏点、偏色、漏光超标都在七天无理由窗口内处理，拖过去只能走保修。"}]}]},{"type":"task_item","attrs":{"checked":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"装完先切 sRGB 模式","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，再把亮度降到 120nit 左右（大约 30–40%），这是长时间写代码最舒服的档位。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"时间上，11 月 10 日 20 点到 11 月 11 日是这轮的主爆发点，显示器这种标品通常在这天出底价；11 月 12–13 日是返场，价格多数会回抬，但断货的颜色/尺寸可能补货。如果不是刚需，等到 10 号晚上再下单，价保期也能覆盖到返场结束。"}]},{"type":"horizontal_rule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"来源与口径"}]},{"type":"bullet_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"价格：什么值得买好价记录（REDMI G27U 2026 天猫 1303.65 元含国补、REDMI G27Q 240Hz 京东 849 元）、京东商品页参数（G27Q 亮度 400cd/㎡、支架旋转升降）。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"规格：超能网（微星 MAG 276QR42、飞利浦 27M4N6500U）、中关村在线（LG 27GX790B、盛色 G72Max、华硕 ROG 绝杀二代）、联想商城产品页（Y27h-30 的 Type-C 75W 反向充电、R27qe Gen2 的 DC 调光与支架行程）。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"价格区间与踩坑：什么值得买社区帖《2K 屏 400 元、OLED 2721》《内存涨硬盘涨，只有显示器在跌》《双 11 买戴尔显示器别急着蹲》，以及国补规则的多篇平台侧说明（家电 6 类 / 数码 4 类、15%、封顶 1500 / 500）。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本文不含任何返利链接或口令","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；检索结果里带「红包口令」「搜 XX 领券」的攻略文，只取了其中的规则描述，没有采信其型号推荐。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"价格为 11 月 2 日首轮活动价，会随库存、地区、账号券变化，最终以结算页为准。"}]}]}]}]},"parentId":"21f6c18cb599","favorite":false,"lastVisitedAt":"2026-11-03T09:29:17.887Z","share":{"token":"C18KMdYelIi9lJkj","enabled":true,"views":6,"createdAt":"2026-11-03T02:00:49.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T02:00:49.578Z","visitors":6},"createdAt":"2026-11-02T13:00:07.522Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T07:01:37.335Z","pinned":false,"pinnedAt":null,"ownerId":"6b7a7531b0f8","acl":{"visibility":"private","members":{},"inherit":true},"canEdit":true,"canManage":true,"visibility":"private","inherit":true},{"id":"21f6c18cb599","title":"双十一","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}},{"type":"horizontal_rule"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}}]},"parentId":null,"favorite":false,"pinned":false,"pinnedAt":null,"lastVisitedAt":"2026-11-09T12:41:09.186Z","share":null,"createdAt":"2026-11-03T05:14:00.563Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T10:58:09.872Z","ownerId":"6b7a7531b0f8","acl":{"visibility":"private","members":{},"inherit":true},"canEdit":true,"canManage":true,"visibility":"private","inherit":true},{"id":"6dfb8daf2d50","title":"2026 双十一成人睡枕推荐：告别肩颈酸痛，一张表看清怎么买","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026 双十一成人睡枕推荐：告别肩颈酸痛，一张表看清怎么买"}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"人的一生约 1/3 时间在睡眠中度过，而枕头是支撑颈椎的关键支点。临床数据显示，约 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"38%"},{"type":"text","text":" 的颈肩部疼痛患者存在枕头使用不当的情况，这一现象在 30–50 岁中青年群体中尤为突出 。双十一临近，正是低价换掉\"服役超 2 年、已塌陷变形\"旧枕的好时机。本文按"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"睡姿 → 材质 → 人群"},{"type":"text","text":"三步，帮你把成人睡枕选对、买值。"}]}]},{"type":"horizontal_rule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一、为什么现在该换枕头"}]},{"type":"bullet_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"旧枕已\"过期\""},{"type":"text","text":"：枕头建议 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"每 1–2 年更换"},{"type":"text","text":"，使用超过 2 年的枕头螨虫尸体含量可超 800 万只，且支撑性能会衰减 30% 以上 。塌陷、异味、晨起频繁肩颈酸痛，都是淘汰信号。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"高度错了伤脊柱"},{"type":"text","text":"：仰卧枕头过高（>12cm）会使椎动脉血流量骤减约 43%，引发晨起头晕；过低则颈部整夜拉伸，落枕概率提升 60% 。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"双十一最划算"},{"type":"text","text":"：寝具大牌（泰普尔、邓禄普、梦百合、罗莱等）通常只在 618 与双十一放价，叠加预售定金膨胀 + 跨店满减 + 保价，到手价往往是全年低点。"}]}]}]},{"type":"horizontal_rule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、三步选对你的枕头"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 1 步：看睡姿定高度"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"睡姿"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"推荐压实高度"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"选枕要点"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"仰睡为主"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"8–10 cm（约一拳）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"颈部被托住、头不顶高；选偏低面"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"侧睡为主"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"10–15 cm（约一拳半，≈单侧肩宽）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"填补肩宽与床面落差；选偏高面"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"仰侧切换频繁"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"双面高低可选（如 8/10cm、9/11cm）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"蝶形/波浪枕容错率高"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"趴睡"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"超低软枕或不用"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"减少颈部扭转（此姿势本身伤颈，建议改）"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"自测：平躺把拳头塞进颈后空隙，轻松穿过说明要垫高，卡住则说明过高 。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"第 2 步：看材质定体感"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"材质"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"优点"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"局限"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"适合谁"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":[288]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"天然乳胶"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","attrs":{"colspan":1,