{"type":"text","text":"一、今日结论（TL;DR）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"今日 Top 20 里，没有一个产品适合直接做成微信小程序；但其中 5 类需求信号可以下沉到微信生态，最终筛出 4 个通过全部 7 条标准的「小而美」创意。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三条硬判断："}]},{"type":"ordered_list","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"品类错配是主体。"},{"type":"text","text":" Top 10 里有 9 个是 AI Agent 基础设施或开发者工具，面向海外开发者与企业，按席位订阅、跑在桌面/云环境。它们解决的是「让 Agent 干活」，不是「微信里搜一下、用完就走」的瞬时痛点。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"大厂正面冲突必须一刀切。"},{"type":"text","text":" Tencent Hy4（腾讯自家）、Stitch.ai（邮件/日历/笔记）、Bridge（视频会议）、FounderMail（域名邮箱）、Tao Browser（多身份浏览器）都能被腾讯系主力产品直接覆盖，按标准 2 淘汰。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"「前 AI 时代没有付费产品」是隐形杀手。"},{"type":"text","text":" Agent 记忆层、Agent 计费、Agent 云真机、Agent 外呼意向数据这类新造需求，在前 AI 时代既无稳定流量也无付费习惯，按标准 7 后半段，AI 化后同样做不成订阅变现，淘汰。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"可迁移的 5 个信号："},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"要被确认/答复"},{"type":"text","text":"（Pushary for Teams）、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"按次按时的钱要对得清"},{"type":"text","text":"（Clocknext）、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"语音变结构化文字"},{"type":"text","text":"（Nemotron Transcribe）、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"客户线索与跟进"},{"type":"text","text":"（Wingmen）、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"小商家自己的品牌物料"},{"type":"text","text":"（Rainbrand）。下沉到国内微信生态后，落到「工头算工钱」「摊主改价签」「档口对账」「私域发圈」这几个具体尴尬瞬间。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、榜单速览与初筛（真实数据）"}]},{