text","text":"，UTC 2026-11-05 日界，Top 20。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"真实字段：name、tagline、description、votesCount、commentsCount、dailyRank、topics；原始 JSON 随报告一同落盘。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"模拟字段：ASO 流行度/难度、竞品月收入稳定性，均为推演，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"上线前必须用真实关键词工具与小程序榜单复核"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"自动化：脚本每日定时抓取并生成同名文档，幂等发布到学城目录 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"http://111.91.20.67:8787/editor/doc/9482de16ff13"},{"type":"text","text":" 下；同日期重复运行为更新而非新建。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}}]},"parentId":"9482de16ff13","favorite":false,"pinned":false,"pinnedAt":null,"lastVisitedAt":"2026-11-09T02:31:29.265Z","share":null,"ownerId":"6b7a7531b0f8","acl":{"visibility":"logged-in","members":{},"inherit":true},"createdAt":"2026-11-06T05:54:51.600Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-06T06:16:34.531Z","canEdit":true,"canManage":true,"visibility":"private","inherit":true},{"id":"867ba447b815","title":"PH每日·微信小程序小而美机会 | 2026-11-08","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Hunt 每日产品 · 微信小程序「小而美」机会筛选 | 2026-11-08"}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"数据口径（先说清楚，避免把推演当实测）","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" - 榜单排名、票数、评论数、产品描述、主题：Product Hunt API v2 GraphQL 真实返回，UTC 日界 2026-11-08，order=RANKING，取 Top 20。 - ASO 流行度 / 难度、竞品月收入："},{"type":"text","text":"方法论模拟估算与 Sensor Tower 式逻辑推演，不是 ASO 工具实测、不是财报数据","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。门槛按既定标准：流行度 > 20%，难度 60%~70%。 - 竞品名称仅用于说明品类形态，收入判断为定性推演。上线前建议用真实关键词工具与小程序榜单复核。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一、今日结论（TL;DR）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"今日 Top 20 里，没有一个产品适合直接做成微信小程序；但其中 3 个产品的需求信号可以下沉到微信生态，最终筛出 4 个通过全部 7 条标准的「小而美」创意（1 个标注变现需验证）。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"三条硬判断："}]},{"type":"ordered_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Mac 桌面工具占了半壁江山，但和微信生态是平行宇宙。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 今天 Archie、Zigzag Browser、Tilde、NotchIsland、Keypause、NotchX 共 6 个都是 macOS 桌面小工具，靠刘海、菜单栏、Finder 这些 Mac 专属场景吃饭。国内微信用户既不用 Mac 也不搜这类词，按标准 1、2 直接整类淘汰。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"开发者 / AI 基础设施是第二主体，全部是「给 Agent 造轮子」。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Sage2、Inkling、NoMac、outages.live、Agent Clan、mamitsu、Wazza Pro 面向海外开发者和企业，跑在桌面/云环境、按席位订阅。它们解决的是「让 Agent 干活」，不是「微信里搜一下、用完就走」的瞬时痛点。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"今天真正能用的 3 个信号，都指向同一件事：把非结构化内容变成结构化数据。","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Textly（截图/PDF/视频→文字表格）、mamitsu（社媒视频→JSON 食材/商品/步骤）、Memorias（口述→回忆录书）。下沉到国内后，落到「截图表格提取」「菜谱视频提取」「带货清单提取」「口述家史」这几个具体尴尬瞬间。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可迁移的 3 个信号："},{"type":"text","text":"非结构化→结构化提取","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（Textly）、"},{"type":"text","text":"视频内容→结构化信息","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（mamitsu）、"},{"type":"text","text":"口述→成书","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（Memorias）。今天没有 11-05 那样的「确认 / 计费 / 客户跟进」类 B2B 信号，所以下沉方向更偏 C 端、更轻。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、榜单速览与初筛（真实数据）"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"排名"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"产品"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","co