nt":[{"type":"text","text":"截图转表格"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"白描、扫描全能王、WPS 图片转表格、夸克扫描"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通用 OCR 把表格认成乱码；只吐一张表不校验数字；导出要开会员；微信里打开链路长"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"流量主为主","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（高频、低客单） + 导出/去水印小额订阅"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"中低但稳：日用频次高，广告填充稳定"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"菜谱视频提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下厨房、豆果、小红书（内容侧），通用视频转文字工具"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容平台只给现成菜谱，无法从任意视频提取；通用转文字不区分食材/步骤/用量"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"订阅制（会员导出购物清单、收藏不限）+ 流量主","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"双轨；前 AI 时代菜谱 App 广告/会员已验证"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"中等：美食长青，但需持续抓新视频源"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"带货清单提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"返利 App、什么值得买、淘宝/拼多多内置找同款"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"比价偏「商品库检索」而非「视频解析」；带货视频里的品常是新奇特，库里没有；不生成可分享的比价表"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导购分佣（帮别人赚钱）+ 流量主","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；分佣模式天然契合「帮用户省钱/赚钱」真需求"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"中高且可放大：带货流量大，分佣随单量增长"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"口述回忆录"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"喜马拉雅/得到的有声书、各类语音转文字、纪念册小程序"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"只做转写不做结构化成书；纪念册偏相册不偏文字；口述散乱无人整理成章"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"按本付费/会员","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（最弱）：低频、客单虽可高但盘子小"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"低且不稳：需求真实但非刚需，复购差"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"淘汰：泛图片转文字"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"白描、夸克扫描、WPS"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已是通用能力，无单点可差异化"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不适合新进入者"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"难度 80%，不建议"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"淘汰：泛比价"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"返利网、什么值得买"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需求已被大厂/导购产品化"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不适合新进入者"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"难度 83% 且正面冲突"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"区分结论","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"："},{"type":"text","text":"菜谱视频提取、带货清单提取适合订阅制/分佣","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（前 AI 时代菜谱 App 与导购分佣已被验证，AI 提高的是「从视频里抓出来」的能力，不改变付费心理）；"},{"type":"text","text":"截图转表格更适合流量主 + 单次导出付费","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（用户价格敏感、单次价值低、但打开频次极高，硬做订阅会把人挡在门外）；"},{"type":"text","text":"口述回忆录变现最弱","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，仅作备选。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"六、Step 5 输出方案"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"产品名称"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"核心使用场景"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"搜索关键词"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小程序的取名"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ASO 预估指标（流行度/难度）"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一句话核心卖点"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"截图表格提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"微商/小店主把客户发来的价目表、快递单、账单截图，一键转成可编辑表格并校验数字"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"截图转表格、图片转excel、表格识别、账单截图转表格、快递单识别"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"截图转表格","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"35% / 65%"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"别家吐给你一张乱码表，这里把数字对齐成能直接用的 Excel，错行自动标红"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"菜谱视频提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷到美食视频，一键提取食材清单 + 步骤 + 生成可打钩的购物清单"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"菜谱提取、美食视频转文字、做菜步骤提取、短视频菜谱、食材清单"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"菜谱提取","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"33% / 62%"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看一个视频直接出「买什么、做几步」，逛超市对照买，不用边看边暂停记"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"带货清单提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷到带货视频，一键提取商品名/价格/店铺，生成可分享的比价表，还能导购分佣"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"带货视频提取、商品清单、好物清单、短视频比价、同款提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好物清单提取","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"31% / 66%"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"视频里不说品牌价，这里把同款挖出来排成表，点一下就能比价还能拿返利"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"口述回忆录（备选，需验证变现）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"给父母录口述家史，自动整理成带章节的电子书，发家族群"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"回忆录制作、口述历史、给父母做书、家史、语音转书"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"口述家史","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"18% / 55%"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"说一段故事，自动理成一本能发的书，比录音和备忘录体面"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小程序取名刻意采用「"},{"type":"text","text":"核心搜索词前置、不加品牌后缀","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"」的 ASO 写法：微信搜一搜对名称权重高，小店主和宝妈不会记品牌名，只会搜「截图转表格」「菜谱提取」这类动作词。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"七、AI-ification 双检验（标准 7）"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"方向"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"去掉 AI 换回传统方案，体验是否明显变差"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"前 AI 时代是否已有付费产品/订阅"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"结论"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"截图表格提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明显变差","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：表格结构识别、错行标红、数字校验全部消失，退回手敲 + 通用 OCR 乱码"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有：白描、扫描全能王订阅会员"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通过","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"菜谱视频提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明显变差","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：传统只能给现成菜谱，无法从任意视频拆出食材/步骤，退回边看边记"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有：下厨房等菜谱 App 广告/会员"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通过","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"带货清单提取"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"几乎失效","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：传统比价靠商品库检索，抓不到视频里的新奇特品，退回人肉搜同款"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有：返利/导购分佣模式"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通过（最强）","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"口述回忆录"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"中等差距","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：退回纯转写 + 人工整理，能出但费时；差距有但非「不可用」"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"弱：有声书/纪念册有，但「口述成书」付费习惯未成"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"勉强通过，变现需验证","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（标准 5 偏弱）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"淘汰：泛图片转文字"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已是传统 OCR 能力，AI 增量小"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有但红海"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不推荐","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（标准 4 难度 80%）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"淘汰：泛比价"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"传统方案已成熟"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有，大厂地盘"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不推荐","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（标准 2、4）"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"八、明确淘汰的方向"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"方向"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"榜单来源信号"}]}]},{"type":"table_header","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"淘汰原因（对应标准）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Mac 桌面工具（截图/浏览器/Finder/刘海/锁键）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Archie、Zigzag、Tilde、NotchIsland、Keypause、NotchX"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标准 1（非小程序形态）、标准 2（国内无场景）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AI Agent 云设备、模型、API、编排"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sage2、Inkling、NoMac、outages.live、Agent Clan、Wazza Pro"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标准 1（不单一）、标准 2（云/开发者地盘）、标准 7（前 AI 无付费验证）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"海外 B2B SaaS（GTM/客服/内容）"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AXL、DocsAlot、Orbi"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标准 1、标准 2（被企业微信/客服系统覆盖）"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"极客/生成玩具"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Deduplication、Frameboy"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标准 5（无稳定变现）、标准 1"}]}]}]},{"type":"table_row","content":[{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"宽泛「图片转文字」「比价神器」"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S1/S3 的泛化版"}]}]},{"type":"table_cell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标准 4（难度 80%/83% 超红海线）"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"九、落地优先级与最小验证动作"}]},{"type":"ordered_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先做「截图表格提取」和「菜谱视频提取」","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：都是把非结构化→结构化的真需求，单功能、开发量小、无需账号体系，且 AI 化差距最明显，与 Textly/mamitsu 信号直接对应。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"验证顺序","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：先用微信搜一搜看核心词的真实下拉与结果页密度，再花 3 天做只含单一功能的版本，观察自然搜索进入量与「导出/发群」按钮点击率；不要一上来做订阅。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"变现顺序","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：截图转表格走流量主 + 单次导出付费；菜谱走次数包/会员；带货清单走导购分佣（最契合「帮别人赚钱」）；口述家史仅作备选，先小流量测付费意愿再决定。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"别碰的","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：任何泛化 OCR、泛比价、需要「建团队/做工作台」的扩展，一旦加上就违反标准 1，也会滑向大厂地盘。"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"十、数据来源与自动化说明"}]},{"type":"bullet_list","content":[{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"数据：Product Hunt API v2 "},{"type":"text","text":"https://api.producthunt.com/v2/api/graphql","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，"},{"type":"text","text":"posts(order: RANKING, postedAfter/postedBefore)","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，UTC 2026-11-08 日界，Top 20。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"真实字段：name、tagline、description、votesCount、commentsCount、dailyRank、topics；原始 JSON 随报告一同落盘。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"模拟字段：ASO 流行度/难度、竞品月收入稳定性，均为推演，"},{"type":"text","text":"上线前必须用真实关键词工具与小程序榜单复核","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"list_item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"自动化：脚本每日定时抓取并生成同名文档，幂等发布到学城目录 "},{"type":"text","text":"http://111.91.20.67:8787/editor/doc/9482de16ff13","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 下；同日期重复运行为更新而非新建。注意：未配置 LLM 时脚本只产出框架版并"},{"type":"text","text":"自动跳过发布","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，避免空壳文档入库——需提供现成报告（"},{"type":"text","text":"--report","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"）或在 config.env 配置 LLM_API_KEY。"}]}]}]}]},"parentId":"9482de16ff13","favorite":false,"pinned":false,"pinnedAt":null,"lastVisitedAt":"2026-11-09T12:39:29.383Z","share":{"token":"AYA4_W-wNZBu2Ck5","enabled":false,"views":0,"createdAt":"2026-11-09T11:29:50.143Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T11:29:51.831Z"},"ownerId":"6b7a7531b0f8","acl":{"visibility":"private","members":{},"inherit":true},"createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:30:17.146Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T02:30:17.146Z","canEdit":true,"canManage":true,"visibility":"private","inherit":true},{"id":"cec6aef237a3","title":"权限测试","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"github PTA:ghp_REDACTED_REMOVED_FROM_HISTORY"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cloudflare："}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"align":null}}]},"parentId":null,"favorite":false,"pinned":false,"pinnedAt":null,"lastVisitedAt":"2026-11-11T11:29:01.261Z","share":null,"ownerId":"6b7a7531b0f8","acl":{"visibility":"private","members":{"56a98eb701e5":"editor"},"inherit":true,"propagate":true},"createdAt":"2026-11-09T12:41:15.178Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-11T11:29:09.249Z","canEdit":true,"canManage":true,"visibility":"private","inherit":true}]');
